msgid ""
"How much of each place is shown in the person boxes: the full name, only the "
"lowest levels, or the place combined with its country as a name or country "
"code. Users switch the places on and off in the chart form."
msgstr ""

#: resources/views/modules/pedigree-chart/page.phtml:39
msgid "Individual"
msgstr "Человек"

#: resources/views/modules/pedigree-chart/form/details.phtml:46
msgid ""
"Inserts the GEDCOM NICK value in quotes between the given names and the "
"surname (e.g. Martin \"Chalky\" White). Mirrors the legacy webtrees "
"behaviour for trees that store nicknames in the separate GEDCOM NICK field."
msgstr ""
"Вставляет значение GEDCOM NICK в кавычках между именами и фамилией "
"(например, Martin \"Chalky\" White). Повторяет прежнее поведение webtrees "
"для деревьев, в которых прозвища хранятся в отдельном поле GEDCOM NICK."

